(text "Existing TA6586; paired outputs 5+6 and 7+8. Carrier is not a complete power/protection circuit." (at 20.32 20.32 0)(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1))(justify left top))(uuid "32afd11d-b4a9-584f-93f4-84a8c36fc080"))
(text "FI/BI pulldowns are on the IC side of series resistors. Motor current never returns through MCU wiring." (at 20.32 25.4 0)(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1))(justify left top))(uuid "b1ae7937-7306-535d-90b8-a5a54f657c9c"))
(text "VM/DRIVE_GND from a separately qualified supply path. No direct battery/charger ground equivalence is implied." (at 20.32 30.48 0)(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1))(justify left top))(uuid "bf34285c-3d29-5eb4-9abc-59db0db6f16e"))
(text "7 A is NOT a board rating. Copper, current, temperature, power sequencing and actual logic levels need bench checks." (at 20.32 35.56 0)(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1))(justify left top))(uuid "1adcc67b-cb18-5ac5-a9a4-633dcf639d68"))
